how + B4 pung + B5 pair\n- Or similar combinations\n\nReason: \nT9 is an isolated tile with poor connection to the rest of my hand. Keeping T5-T6 maintains a potential chow sequence, while B4-B4-B5-B5-B6 offers multiple completion paths with excellent tile availability. This maximizes my winning chances.\n\nAnswer: Play T9"}
